  "arrangerNotes": "The opening 4-bar flute theme, verified against the LilyPond excerpt on Norwegian (Bokmål) Wikipedia. Two acciaccatura grace notes left out. Played one octave lower than the flute (the whole theme sits in the main octave). Written in Grieg's 6/8 (eighth = 0.5 beat; the excerpt's last bar is engraved incomplete and ends on the held 1). Range 1–6, minLayout 8. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
  "verified": true
